    "label": "Column headers",
    "help_text": "Each header becomes one column. Add, remove, or reorder headers to change the table's column count - the layout adapts automatically. When adding or removing a header, add or remove the matching cell in every row below (in the same position) so rows and columns stay aligned - HubSpot does not link the two repeaters automatically.",
