            "help_text": "Applies only to this cell's own Value text above - never the cell background, the mobile label, or any other cell. Leave as None for plain text (e.g. a Capability description, a dash, or \"Partial\"); choose a color for a value that acts as a check/status indicator (e.g. a checkmark).",
